# The return ability's cost includes {T} (CR 302.6): the turn the Familiar enters it can't be activated, though a card to
# discard and the mana to pay ({1}{G} from the untapped Mox Emerald and Mox Pearl) are there. The control, the same ability
# used from turn 5 on, is bramble-familiar-discards-a-card-to-return-itself-to-hand.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Forest
Bramble Familiar
Island
Island
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

